  "contentHtml": "\n<div><!--IMG1--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121231165520im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/55266994.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG1--><br>1986 онд цөмийн хамгийн том аймшигтай сүйрэл болсоныг хүн бүр \nмэддэг. Тэнд хохирсон хүмүүсийн 60 илүү хувь нь хүүхдүүд байсан гэхээр \nүнэхээр харамсалтай бас гунигтай. Тэрнээс хойш өнөөг хүртэл 20-иод \nжилийн турш энэ газарт огт хүн амьдраагүй билээ. Цөмийн сүйрлийн хамгийн\n том сургамж бүхий энэхүү сүйрэл Белорусийн хилийн ойролцоох Припят \nхотын Чернобылийн атомын цахилгаан станцад болсон билээ. Өдгөө Припят \n\"Сүнсний хот\" болсон гэдэг. Бүх хүн төрлөхтөнд энэ бол онцгой хориотой \nбүс болжээ. Сүйрсэн атомын цахилгаан станцын эргэн тойронд өтгөн ногоон \nой, тосгон суурин бий. Тэнд гэрийн тэжээвэр амьтад л сууршин үлдэж үр \nудмаа төрүүлэн хэвийн амьдарч байгаа юм. Муур гэхэд л дөрөвдэхь үедээ \nамьдарч байна хаягдсан байшин дотор амьдралж үргэлжилж байна.\n<br><!--IMG2--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/62764946.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121231165520im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/s62764946.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG2--><br><!--IMG3--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/63978065.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121231165520im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/s63978065.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG3--><br><!--IMG4--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/65727241.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121231165520im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/s65727241.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG4--><br><!--IMG5--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121231165520im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/22303814.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG5--><br><!--IMG6--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121231165520im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/11228117.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG6--><br><!--IMG7--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/13353568.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121231165520im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/s13353568.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG7--><br><!--IMG8--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121231165520im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/45533380.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG8--><br><!--IMG9--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121231165520im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/58889463.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG9--><br><!--IMG10--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121231165520im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/79983564.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG10--><br><!--IMG11--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121231165520im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/79492579.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG11--><br><!--IMG12--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/40831329.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121231165520im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/s40831329.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG12--><br><!--IMG13--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121231165520im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/69752865.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG13--><br><!--IMG14--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/09569504.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121231165520im_/http://www.horiotoi.